<title>USA: Marathon sets $1.2 bln 1997 capital budget.</title>
<headline>Marathon sets $1.2 bln 1997 capital budget.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USX Corp has approved a 1997 capital investment and exploration budget of $1.2 billion for the Marathon Group, 43 percent more than the one last year, USX-Marathon Group said Tuesday.</p>
</text>
